d KEX/host-key/cipher/MAC. UNIT-TEST driven over an in-memory/loopback byte seam (no live SSH fixtures — those are 39xz9g; cross-engine conformance is 2d3g5e; functional/scale is 1u2vpc, P0-gated). This is a CANDIDATE, not the selection (1gjxer). Build+test via swift build/test on macOS. If a contract clause genuinely cannot be satisfied by libssh2 public API, STOP-THE-LINE with the exact gap (that would signal a contract revision, a bigger decision) — do not force-fit.
