   144	Rules:
   145	
   146	- `connect` is valid only in `idle`. Concurrent or repeated calls fail with
   147	  `invalidState`; they never start a second socket.
   148	- Host policy is the sole exit from `awaitingHostDecision`. Authentication
   149	  cannot begin before an accept decision.
   150	- `connect` returns only in `ready`, after authentication succeeds. The returned
